{"id":"n17313-2-7","stage":1,"title":"첫째 · 老大","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17313-2-7-1","ko":"옆집 부부가 사고로 갑자기 죽었다며?","zh":"听说隔壁夫妻俩在事故中突然去世了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옆집","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71723","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부부가","meaning":"夫妻，夫妇","explanation":"부부：夫妻，夫妇；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부부","audio":"/audio/5b6b5a16786532a073e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32206","senseId":"1","lemma":"부부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사고로","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"1","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"죽었다며?","meaning":"死","explanation":"죽다：死；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"죽다","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20851","senseId":"1","lemma":"죽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d4901559765ba929","term":"옆집","zh":"邻居，隔壁","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3","entryId":"71723","definition":"旁边的一家。","pronunciation":["엽찝"]},{"id":"5b6b5a16786532a0","term":"부부","zh":"夫妻，夫妇","audio":"/audio/5b6b5a16786532a073e7.mp3","entryId":"32206","definition":"丈夫与妻子。","pronunciation":["부부"]},{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"事故","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3","entryId":"66370","definition":"意料之外发生的不好的事情。","pronunciation":["사ː고"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"66bd3b1f27c0ee2e","term":"죽다","zh":"死","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3","entryId":"20851","definition":"生物失去生命。","pronunciation":["죽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/004a4eb0ea88fdc53cec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17313-2-7-2","ko":"응. 그래서 첫째가 가장이 되어 동생들을 돌보게 되었대.","zh":"嗯，听说家里最大的孩子成了顶梁柱，要照顾弟妹。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"첫째가","meaning":"老大","explanation":"첫째：老大；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"첫째","audio":"/audio/3f038018ca33140ec291.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17313","senseId":"2","lemma":"첫째","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가장이","meaning":"一家之主，户主，家长","explanation":"가장：一家之主，户主，家长；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"가장","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15145","senseId":"1","lemma":"가장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되어","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동생들을","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌보게","meaning":"照顾，照看","explanation":"돌보다：照顾，照看；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"돌보다","audio":"/audio/bb6524970702f93b5ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61310","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되었대.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"3f038018ca33140e","term":"첫째","zh":"老大","audio":"/audio/3f038018ca33140ec291.mp3","entryId":"17313","definition":"几个兄弟姐妹中最年长的人。","pronunciation":["첫째"]},{"id":"8fd32c9572450a80","term":"가장","zh":"一家之主，户主，家长","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3","entryId":"15145","definition":"代表并负责一个家庭的人。 主要指家里的男性长者。","pronunciation":["가장"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为；变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"bb6524970702f93b","term":"돌보다","zh":"照顾，照看","audio":"/audio/bb6524970702f93b5ae2.mp3","entryId":"61310","definition":"对某个对象关心并保护照顾。","pronunciation":["돌ː보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dc989a3fedb7f10882bf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.388,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17313","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":44,"sequenceScore":1.9856,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，听说家里最大的孩子成了顶梁柱，要照顾弟妹。","假期你打算做些什么呢？","听说隔壁夫妻俩在事故中突然去世了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，听说家里最大的孩子成了顶梁柱，要照顾弟妹。","听说隔壁夫妻俩在事故中突然去世了？","假期你打算做些什么呢？"],"answer":0}]}
